#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:3
#: f887eea9810642628d8b43611f7238b5
msgid "FPS 过滤（FPS Filter）"
msgstr "FPS Filter"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:5
#: 3ff48ad16143443fbe21c6adf94a94ad
msgid "`Group`: `Filter` | `Class`: `FPSFilterDataCard`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:7
#: d4db257bf8a74a0d8be46ef905f1be9f
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:9
#: e0f23e45cdda4326806177a9068d5331
msgid ""
"基于 NEP 描述符空间的最远点采样（FPS），从大批量结构中挑选代表性子集，去除冗余同时保留多样性。需要提供一个 NEP 模型文件（如内置的 "
"`nep89.txt` 或你自己训练的模型）用于生成描述符。"
msgstr ""
"Use farthest-point sampling (FPS) in NEP descriptor space to select a "
"representative subset from a large pool, reducing redundancy while retaining"
" diversity. A usable NEP model, such as the bundled `nep89.txt` or a system-"
"specific model, is required to compute descriptors."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:11
#: 7ef8cabec21e45f0835d1f2e5ba83719
#, python-brace-format
msgid "\\mathbf{d}_i=\\mathrm{NEP}(\\text{structure}_i)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:13
#: adfe7ff712d3479eb4e94e6ff9b0b6f1
msgid ""
"i_t=\\arg\\max_j\\ \\min_{i\\in "
"S_{t-1}}\\lVert\\mathbf{d}_j-\\mathbf{d}_i\\rVert_2,\\quad "
"S_t=S_{t-1}\\cup\\{i_t\\}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:15
#: 6d86307b4a1c41dc964aca747ed7c117
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:17
#: 5ce3d352caf44c76b801cd60b1f8811a
msgid "场景：2000 个候选结构训练出来效果不如 200 个精选的"
msgstr "Scenario: 2,000 candidates perform worse than 200 selected structures"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:19
#: 83c714ad8a914e19bd33f50c96987d06
msgid ""
"你用多张生成卡产出了 2000 个候选结构，全部丢进训练集跑了 DFT 计算。重训后模型精度比只用前 200 个结构手动挑的版本还差——2000 "
"个结构里大量重复构型，有效多样性反而被稀释了。"
msgstr ""
"Several generators produce 2,000 candidates and all are labeled by DFT, yet "
"the retrained model is worse than one trained on 200 manually selected "
"structures. Heavy duplication diluted effective diversity."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:21
#: b115bb80195047c3aacd49d3d5bfd158
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** 卡片生成的候选集有大量统计冗余。比如 `Random Vacancy` 生成了 200 个空位结构，但从描述符角度看可能只有 15 "
"种真正不同的局域环境。FPS 可以在描述符空间里按\"最远优先\"的原则挑出最不相似的子集，保留多样性去掉冗余。"
msgstr ""
"**Diagnosis:** Generated pools often contain statistical redundancy: 200 "
"random vacancies may represent only 15 distinct local environments. FPS "
"greedily chooses points farthest from the selected set in descriptor space, "
"preserving diversity while removing near-duplicates."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:23
#: b3845798ed2844adb5555a7894082dc2
msgid "**输入：** 2000 个候选结构，以及一个可用的 `nep89.txt` 模型文件"
msgstr "**Input:** 2,000 cleaned candidates and a usable NEP model file."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:25
#: 629a0615fff0447c9415551f9d2f3d68
msgid "**目标：** 从 2000 个中挑出 200 个最具代表性的结构"
msgstr "**Objective:** Select 200 representative structures."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:27
#: 19a78215d7524403a25cf6b47328efd6
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:28
#: 4ea9804758114315b328e09d97ce1b14
msgid "`Nep Path` = 指向你的 NEP 模型文件路径"
msgstr "`Nep Path` = path to the NEP model"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:29
#: 0223969724e6421e9e5324d8048797fb
msgid "`Num Condition` = `[200]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:30
#: 314dd2493c884fdd863f4db2ea83fa2d
msgid "`Min Distance Condition` = `[0.01]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:32
#: a1cf63035a8d492d861ed902a5bd3bd1
msgid "**输出：** 200 个结构，在描述符空间中两两距离尽可能大，覆盖输入集的多样性"
msgstr ""
"**Output:** Up to 200 structures chosen to spread coverage through the input"
" descriptor space."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:34
#: 02c94e8674284b7f94fe706bffc4e28a
msgid "**怎么验证挑选质量：**"
msgstr "**How to verify selection quality:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:35
#: a5c4b94dc9ef4725b94b729e8cfa69db
msgid "重训后用同一组测试集对比：FPS 精选 200 个 vs 随机抽 200 个，前者精度应更高"
msgstr ""
"Train on 200 FPS-selected versus 200 randomly selected structures and "
"compare on the same test set; FPS should improve or preserve accuracy."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:36
#: fd8b72105e714d34950252ab2d6370e1
msgid "如果 200 个不够，增大 `num_condition` 到 500"
msgstr "If 200 is insufficient, increase `num_condition`, for example to 500."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:37
#: 5dcd8650b6744425b898beb72876a33c
msgid "如果挑出的结构仍有重复感，增大 `min_distance_condition` 到 0.05~0.1"
msgstr ""
"If selected structures remain redundant, test a larger "
"`min_distance_condition`, such as 0.05-0.1."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:38
#: 7160f1c18df349d7824870032ac99467
msgid "注意：FPS 只挑不造——如果输入池本身没有某类构型，FPS 不会凭空变出来"
msgstr ""
"FPS selects but never generates. A missing configuration family cannot "
"appear unless it exists in the input pool."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:40
#: 2304191cc7dc4ed7ba0b9985b44a5128
msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
msgstr "When to add this card"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:42
#: b64a07f0466c4eb5a7f8d81d3ffbb6f8
msgid "**加：**"
msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:43
#: 365bbe91dce7488fac8f7baccabec529
msgid "生成链条产生了大量结构（>500），需要去冗余"
msgstr "A generation chain produced hundreds of structures and needs deduplication"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:44
#: 0c765b946f8a4d3db636d51920682f02
msgid "怀疑训练集有大量重复/高度相似的构型"
msgstr "The pool likely contains many duplicate or highly similar configurations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:45
#: 1339c2d088494976aee7c9812368120d
msgid "需要在保持覆盖的前提下压缩训练集体积"
msgstr "The dataset must be compressed while retaining coverage"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:47
#: ff9a91431a204ce387a0fc65b1a5f4af
msgid "**不加：**"
msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:48
#: 0fb9e116056242ec919496c802856258
msgid "还在生成阶段，结构数量很少（<50）"
msgstr "The pool is still small"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:49
#: 5deda45531cc449f976710389c029b73
msgid "输入池本身还没经过物理清洗（如已用 NEP 预筛、剔除异常结构）"
msgstr "The input pool has not yet been physically cleaned"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:50
#: ae68e092493e4fb4b456514d7575608d
msgid "模型还没训练出来——FPS 需要一个可用的 NEP 模型来生成描述符"
msgstr "No suitable NEP model is available for descriptors"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:52
#: 74fe518f453c46689db44fc8dc931254
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:53
#: 03550fdf2eef4dd7b491d435d3584390
msgid "Nep Path（nep_path）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:54
#: 21e3b8e2c97544d1a641d113f740f97f
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `MISSING`。指向用于生成 NEP 描述符的模型文件，必须是一个可用的 NEP 模型文件（如 `nep.txt` 或内置 "
"`nep89.txt`）。路径为空或文件不存在时卡片直接报错。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `MISSING`. Path to a usable NEP model such as `nep.txt` or "
"bundled `nep89.txt`. The card fails if the path is empty or nonexistent."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:56
#: 7821ca48854f45369be46c7d0caf5a34
msgid "N Samples（n_samples）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:57
#: ee6830f7e8ad4b7c86f3bd60ef832214
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 100。FPS 过滤后保留的代表结构数。这是输出数量，不是上游生成数量——DFT "
"预算固定时直接设你计划算的上限；但设太小会把稀有构型也筛掉。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `100`. Maximum representative outputs. It is an output count,"
" not an upstream generation count. Match it to the DFT budget while leaving "
"enough capacity for rare families."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:59
#: 1641fabb61974b13ae4feb7e476c4628
msgid "Min Distance（min_distance）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:60
#: c6a3d6e0599c4c1b950ee2ec7d3e53bb
msgid "`float`，默认 0.01。描述符空间中的最小距离阈值。值越大去重越激进，但设太大 FPS 会过早停、选不够数；设太小又可能混入近重复结构。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0.01`. Minimum distance in descriptor space. Larger values"
" deduplicate more aggressively but can stop before reaching the requested "
"count; smaller values admit near-duplicates."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:62
#: 0b533c1b4fa84f9583b333452bf90f2b
msgid "Backend（backend）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:63
#: 9c2ea0f30a8246879d97bd8ad46fb097
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `'auto'`。描述符计算后端。正常保持 `auto` 让程序自己选可用的 NEP "
"后端；只有在你需要调试性能或对比后端差异时才手动指定。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `'auto'`. Descriptor backend. Keep automatic selection unless"
" diagnosing performance or backend differences."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:65
#: d62a0f8c6192465f8b355ffd15b6d9b8
msgid "Batch Size（batch_size）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:66
#: bb0bafefd4a34b55975004120aef1510
msgid "`int`，默认 1000。描述符批处理大小，只影响吞吐和内存。GPU 或大体系可以调大加速，内存紧张时适当调小。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `1000`. Descriptor batch size; affects throughput and memory "
"only. Increase when the backend and memory allow, and reduce under memory "
"pressure."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:68
#: 0520a571c8164e7ca7d7b511222b0125
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:70
#: 365d0a69dcbf4eb58b6f3ff558ec038a
msgid "轻度去重（保留 100 个，min_dist 0.01）"
msgstr "Light deduplication (keep 100, min_dist 0.01)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:71
#: b38c725a1a064a16b271ef0dec5b77c1
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"FPSFilterDataCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"nep_path\": \"path/to/nep.txt\",\n"
"    \"n_samples\": 100,\n"
"    \"min_distance\": 0.01,\n"
"    \"backend\": \"auto\",\n"
"    \"batch_size\": 1000\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:85
#: c5e6bef8be0a41f49e030831abce48fb
msgid "常规去重（保留 200 个，min_dist 0.03）"
msgstr "Routine deduplication (keep 200, min_dist 0.03)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:86
#: f4928e46d8ed4e0b815d922b9f36c7ba
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"FPSFilterDataCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"nep_path\": \"path/to/nep.txt\",\n"
"    \"n_samples\": 200,\n"
"    \"min_distance\": 0.03,\n"
"    \"backend\": \"auto\",\n"
"    \"batch_size\": 1000\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:100
#: be1efc63a5b14cc882c0379099a0ad7c
msgid "强去重（保留 50 个，min_dist 0.06）"
msgstr "Strong deduplication (keep 50, min_dist 0.06)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:101
#: 823ef6dba70e488cad2c0c7ddf1a2f53
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"FPSFilterDataCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"nep_path\": \"path/to/nep.txt\",\n"
"    \"n_samples\": 50,\n"
"    \"min_distance\": 0.06,\n"
"    \"backend\": \"auto\",\n"
"    \"batch_size\": 1000\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:115
#: 01b7283e74a947abb07888a12b8ac579
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:117
#: 5f63eab2f3914841a72fd283c8d54e10
msgid "任意生成链 → `NEP Dataset Display` 清洗 → `FPS Filter`：先去掉明显坏结构，再做代表性筛选"
msgstr ""
"Any generation chain -> clean in `NEP Dataset Display` -> `FPS Filter`: "
"remove invalid geometry before representative sampling"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:118
#: 869b83f366a244c2be10842d3171c466
msgid "`FPS Filter` → 导出 DFT 计算：控制进入 DFT 计算的结构数量，节省计算资源"
msgstr "`FPS Filter` -> DFT export: bound the number of expensive labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:119
#: a83738135c4343529c6665d1c0afcc7c
msgid "多分支汇总后 → `FPS Filter`：先汇总各分支输出，再统一挑选"
msgstr ""
"Merged branch outputs -> `FPS Filter`: select across all branches "
"consistently"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:121
#: 6a1ec7bcbbe14e4f9982c6e25c465b4e
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:123
#: 0d7c2937acba445c88dda134d03754bb
msgid "**卡片报错\"NEP file does not exist\"。** `nep_path` 指向的文件不存在。确认路径正确。"
msgstr "**`NEP file does not exist`.** Correct `nep_path` to an existing model file."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:125
#: 64b48ab0ea694d2687075565b7f67659
msgid ""
"**输出数量远小于 `num_condition`。** `min_distance_condition` "
"太严，无法选出足够多满足距离约束的结构。降低该阈值。"
msgstr ""
"**Output is far below `num_condition`.** `min_distance_condition` is too "
"strict; lower it to allow more selections."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:127
#: cabd2c4f49334172aeca9b213be44145
msgid "**挑出的结构覆盖不全。** FPS 只能从现有池里选。如果某些局域环境在输入池里本来就没有，FPS 也无法补充。回到上游增加生成多样性。"
msgstr ""
"**Coverage remains incomplete.** FPS cannot create absent environments. Add "
"the missing diversity upstream."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:129
#: 707f7946d48342b080acd46b88788b9d
msgid "**描述符计算很慢。** 大批量（>5000）时描述符计算可能耗时。先用 `FPS Filter` 之前控制好上游输出量。"
msgstr ""
"**Descriptor calculation is slow.** Pools above several thousand structures "
"can be expensive. Bound upstream generation and tune batch size before "
"sampling."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:131
#: cead5fc7d4fc4344bdf6ebc0d5c7be91
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:133
#: 9da1de09275a45cfbabb962acbb4b546
msgid "不新增专用 Config_type 标签。输出结构保留原标签。"
msgstr ""
"No dedicated `Config_type` is added; selected structures preserve their "
"existing labels."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:135
#: 41212fac47cd424bbe66a95267edd4bd
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:137
#: 23fd8b95c838402ca8ce00257deab4c6
msgid "无随机性。同参数同输入 → 严格一致输出。FPS 是确定性贪心算法。"
msgstr ""
"Deterministic: identical inputs and parameters produce identical output "
"because FPS is a deterministic greedy algorithm."
